WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.498
To isolate why it works,

00:00:01.578 --> 00:00:09.124
the authors replace the transformer layers with
RegretNet's fully-connected and EquivariantNet's equivariant layers,

00:00:09.204 --> 00:00:11.754
giving CIRegretNet and CIEquivariantNet.

00:00:11.834 --> 00:00:15.502
Both still get context, yet earn less revenue everywhere,

00:00:15.582 --> 00:00:18.329
pinning the gain on the transformer layers.

00:00:18.409 --> 00:00:21.090
Removing context hurts even easy settings.
